{"title": "Stinking Cloud (cloud)", "pageid": 39881, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Stinking_Cloud_(cloud)", "categories": ["Clouds", "Areas"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"min-height: 200px\" class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Stinking_Cloud_cloud.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Stinking_Cloud_cloud.png/300px-Stinking_Cloud_cloud.png.webp, /w/images/6/6e/Stinking_Cloud_cloud.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stinking Cloud (cloud) image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Stinking_Cloud_cloud.png/300px-Stinking_Cloud_cloud.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6e/Stinking_Cloud_cloud.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Stinking Cloud</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Cloud\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cloud\">cloud</a> that pacifies creatures within, preventing them from taking actions.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>Creatures caught in this cloud might be prevented from taking actions due to its foul smell.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/38px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a